      "writtenOn": "2017-10-03T03:05:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u0027mRequestedLanguage\u0027 can be updated in this method, but \u0027currentLanguage\u0027 is from the present system locale. User can change the launguage setting in the settings application even after it was once changed by LAUNGUAGE NOTIFICATION command. The last requested language and the current language can be different in that case. We think that user preference should be prioritized.",
